---
/**
 * 404 page.
 *
 * Without this file Cloudflare Pages falls back to serving dist/index.html for
 * any unmatched path — which is the meta-refresh redirect shell from
 * index.astro. The result was that EVERY unknown URL answered **HTTP 200** and
 * bounced the visitor to /en/: an unbounded crawlable URL space all returning
 * the same "page", and Soft 404 errors in Search Console. Astro emits this file
 * as dist/404.html, which Pages serves with a real 404 status.
 *
 * Deliberately bilingual and static: a 404 can be reached from either locale (or
 * from none — a bare mistyped path has no language), so it shows both rather
 * than guessing. No Svelte islands, no fonts, no video — an error page should be
 * the cheapest thing on the site.
 */
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <!-- An error page must never be indexed, and must not pass link equity. -->
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <title>404 — Page not found | VKVstudio</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="code">404</p>
      <h1>This page doesn't exist</h1>
      <p class="sub">Такой страницы нет.</p>

      <nav aria-label="Where to go next">
        <a href="/en/">← Home</a>
        <a href="/ru/">← Главная</a>
      </nav>

      <p class="hint">The Lab / Лаборатория</p>
      <nav aria-label="Lab tools">
        <a href="/en/lab/tokenizer/">Tokenizer</a>
        <a href="/en/lab/prompt/">Prompt Architect</a>
        <a href="/en/lab/embeddings/">Embeddings</a>
      </nav>
    </main>

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: #05070a;
        color: #e6f2ef;
        font-family:
          ui-sans-serif,
          system-ui,
          -apple-system,
          'Segoe UI',
          sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      }
      main {
        max-width: 34rem;
      }
      .code {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: ui-monospace, 'JetBrains Mono', 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
        font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 14vw, 6rem);
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        color: #30e8e8;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0.75rem 0 0.25rem;
        font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 1.75rem);
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .sub {
        margin: 0 0 2rem;
        color: #8fa6a2;
      }
      .hint {
        margin: 2.25rem 0 0.75rem;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #64807c;
      }
      nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      nav a {
        /* 24px minimum target size — WCAG 2.2 SC 2.5.8, same rule applied
           across the rest of the site. */
        min-height: 44px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0 1rem;
        border: 1px solid #1d3330;
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: #cfe9e4;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease-out, color 0.2s ease-out;
      }
      nav a:hover,
      nav a:focus-visible {
        border-color: #30e8e8;
        color: #ffffff;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
